  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THRIVE - Together for Her: Resilience-building, Inclusivity and Voices for Equality</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This program seeks to economically and socially empower marginalised women in Sri Lanka and ensure their resilience in times of crisis, insecurity, and in a changing climate. Three interlinked outcomes include: i) marginalised women&#x2019;s enterprises, in rural, tea plantation and urban poor settings, are better able to navigate and recover from climate-related and other crises; ii) Community members and leaders demonstrate favourable behaviour and attitudes towards gender equality and address harmful social norms, discrimination, and social exclusion and iii) More women and marginalised groups are exercising their voice, agency and leadership including though an enabling environment that supports their engagement in decision-making spaces.</narrative>
  </description>
